  "title": "More ways to make images",
  "summary": "New image and text models, 3D generation in Floret, and a model catalog that puts recent reliability up front.\n\nMicrosoft MAI Image 2.6 and 2.6 Flash were added for generation and single-reference edits up to 1536 × 1536. FLUX 1.1 Pro was added for text-to-image generation with reproducible seeds. The per-user request gates were also removed from GPT Image 2, 2.5 Flare, and 2.5 Sunburst.\n\nGPT-5.3 Codex and Xiaomi MiMo V2.6 Flash and Pro joined the text model list. Codex supports tools, reasoning, and image input; both MiMo variants support those capabilities with million-token context windows. MiniMax M2.7 was rerouted so requests reach M2.7 rather than being forwarded to M3. Model documentation and the README were refreshed.\n\nFloret can now generate 3D assets from a prompt, optionally using an image reference, and return hosted download links. Its FFmpeg tool can process public HTTPS sources and return hosted output; media uploads now accept URLs or data URIs rather than workspace paths.",
